[{"title":"坌山作 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"不到普陀岩，普门身忽现。\n万古海潮音，自此十方遍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":257,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"坌山作 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"遇方亦成圭，石际一泓注。\n不敢漱吾齿，上有徐凝句。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":258,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"坌山作 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"眺远鸡笼山，寒袭鸡笼雪。\n亭午尚添衣，那堪曦景灭。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":259,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将与伯卿别过官斋作此","author":"朱景英","text":"海外成轻别，年时海外逢。\n素心无几辈，华发剩孤踪。\n不转有如石，后凋惟此松。\n眷言存息壤，庭际怅相从。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":260,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七月三日伯卿之任六安予送至海门诗以言别","author":"朱景英","text":"灊霍雄南服，君行迫简书。\n筹纡六蓼国，梦远二峨居。\n祖帐当秋早，移舟忆夏初。\n海门离合地，啼笑意何如。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":261,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕微雨病不成寐忆昨年是夕偕白颖亭阮辅臣集任伯卿官斋宴饮欢甚今白阮俱下世伯卿亦迁任去抚今追昔不胜怆然","author":"朱景英","text":"依然逢此夕，隔岁事增悲。\n南蒲销魂日，西州陨涕时。\n星怜河鼓寂，浪聒海门驰。\n一雨宵深坐，知予病强支。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":262,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋夜闻涛图为石乐莘国任作歌","author":"朱景英","text":"世事矜奇宁有□。\n□先□□□水。\n一官局促冷无比，耐可置身千万里。\n白波中来悸欲死，耳聒侏?目恢诡。\n坐荫多罗树深底，种杏非坛槐非市。\n片席何为设于是，而今乃见徂徕子。\n前年螺江别，一船□图史。\n卓尔宋山长，依然秦博士。\n经解驳而铿铿，笔纵横而纚纚，亦战膏粱濯纨绮。\n得静者机抉其理，谓根群动动如□。\n秋风拉瑟秋涛起，作彻夜声喧未已。\n忽如迅霆奋地纪，忽如飙轮干嵔㠥。\n又如五兵所向纷披靡，之子嗒然槁梧倚。\n以无闻参有闻旨，是为静摄动则尔。\n涛声在海不在纸，以纸写涛亦枝指。\n卷图还子笑相视，此意勿语坳堂蚁。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":263,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋昼苦热与李槎寄施韨堂坐澹怀轩即事有作 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"兼旬金序木延凉，苦盼西风阻瘴乡。\n岁阅四时皆夏令，候当七月剧秋阳。\n雁鸿音断书千里，芦荻花稀水一方。\n底不遥天动愁思，楚人生性爱沅湘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":264,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋昼苦热与李槎寄施韨堂坐澹怀轩即事有作 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"行吟坐啸三间屋，饭罢眠馀一碊茶。\n不惯逢迎如隐客，未偿笔墨似逋家。\n元之笺疏专门重，白也诗篇浪迹赊。\n要与陈人同寂寞，晚风消受贝多花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":265,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题戎装丽人图","author":"朱景英","text":"盘马腰身试几曾，边风吹动影凌兢。\n解围谢女浑閒事，却对丹青忆白登。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":266,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"恽道生画山水歌","author":"朱景英","text":"毗陵恽氏工作画，正叔本在道生后。\n正叔写生妙入神，何似道生挥毫如运帚。\n胸中邱壑蟠几许，落手寻丈等粒黍。\n笔底已无高房山，眼边不数米家虎。\n由来大巧无纤辞，讵有大力肯事轻描淡写为。\n窠臼尽脱笔墨外，不施皴染艺更奇。\n多君论画兼论文，读书读画同所云。\n愚意读画仍自读书始，俗工院体徒纷纷。\n世人但爱南田子，花叶工为没骨体。\n边徐而后叹独绝，寸缣尺素珍莫比。\n我获此幅赏其大落墨，是用作歌表奇伟。\n噫嚱吁，读画录中传久矣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":267,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"经剌桐围怀伯卿","author":"朱景英","text":"聚散真无定，离愁积未删。\n故人万里外，树色一围间。\n风雨江南道，云烟海上山。\n相违忽相忆，行处泪痕斑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":268,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十月十一日过馀斋听陈山人鸣谦弹琴","author":"朱景英","text":"海上稀闻雁，横琴奏塞鸿。\n何心避矰缴，馀响散丝桐。\n伫兴七弦遍，经时尺素通。\n怀哉岁将晏，木落楚江东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":269,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"腊夜","author":"朱景英","text":"海外腊三度，灯前泪一挥。\n死生俱异域，夷险本忘机。\n夜寂风声厉，愁多酒力微。\n家人应念我，头白尚征衣。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":270,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"朱景英","text":"家山别去九经霜，岁籥频更拙宦场。\n垂橐金无馀陆贾，盈头发已变冯唐。\n梅花海外谁传讯，柏叶宵分独举觞。\n坐听东风吹欲遍，新年寒谷转春阳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":271,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"壬辰1772元日立春","author":"朱景英","text":"东皇暖艳履端浮，启曙苍龙应候游。\n行处阳春原有脚，吹来太簇正从头。\n云占三素仪金凤，冻破重阴出土牛。\n祥序屡逢矜盛事，咏歌何限起沧洲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":272,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清荫堂观奕作","author":"朱景英","text":"绿泻当庭一榻清，东风无力动帘旌。\n竹炉初煖茶烟细，静听楸枰落子声。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":273,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日即事","author":"朱景英","text":"新年剧人事，乘暇度兹辰。\n竹叶虽无分，梅花得少亲。\n清晖揽如许，旧雨话何频。\n不觉西窗晚，烦纡散几巡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":274,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶花 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"褰帷晓色透疏窗，缬眼秾华扑玉缸。\n老大心情解相惜，争教传唱到春江。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":275,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶花 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"攲斜态亦自然佳，晕脸初匀镜槛排。\n看未回身春已熟，斑骓谁踏洛阳街。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":276,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶花 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"解脱根荄自水南，军持色相幻瞿昙。\n道人近得观空法，种种维摩病后参。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":277,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"瓶花 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"轻风飘飐影纤纤，为护馀香不捲帘。\n几点落红随意数，引他绮思上毫尖。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":278,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"遣家人送二侄柩渡海归诗以志悲","author":"朱景英","text":"三年海外身，就木已一载。\n旅殡良可悲，况复阻巨海。\n汝来我是偕，汝归我独在。\n来归无差殊，月日闇相待。\n肠脑汝正盛，齿发我渐改。\n无年为谁恸，远宦只自悔。\n彭殇理一致，达者得无乃。\n雪涕奚所从，含酸诉真宰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":279,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题王石谷寒夜联吟图","author":"朱景英","text":"乾莎满地霜华净，丛筱依墙风籁咏。\n空旻一片月轮寒，孤照藤萝光不定。\n乌目山前旧草堂，朋簪歙集倾壶觞。\n炉煨榾柮拨不尽，冷灰残烛谭何长。\n须臾寒光透虚牖，瑟缩蟾蜍泪凝久。\n■毫呵冻各匠心，茧纸铺银竞叉手。\n耕烟散人画绝伦，以画代诗更逼真。\n眼边粉本摹能肖，笔底丹青妙入神。\n古人作画皆有意，或传故实或即事。\n曾图屈子离骚经，亦写卢鸿草堂志。\n君家右丞姿绝奇，诗中有画画中诗。\n散人诗句故不俗，写意时复髣髴之。\n我携此幅来海外，珍重频将玉叉挂。\n为题长句代君诗，愧我难效诗中画。\n却想江南冰雪庐，飞觥刻烛兴何如。\n祇今画在诗篇逸，令人空忆骊龙珠。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":280,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感兴 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"陶公高秋人，性本不谐俗。\n至慎阮步兵，猊以狂自覆。\n贤者涉末流，迷阳伤却曲。\n要不小其身，高厚何蹐局。\n抵鹊猥以珠，腊鼠矜为璞。\n所识故茫昧，况乃耳代目。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":281,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感兴 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"鸾鹤无卑响，松柏无凡枝。\n寥天邈何闻，幽谷闇勿知。\n翔者高且远，植者古以奇。\n物各有本性，人乃盭窒之。\n风不散太音，雪不虐贞姿。\n昭质完无亏，造物岂有私。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":282,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感兴 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"山吾知其高，海吾知其深。\n相于而白首，吾不知其心。\n古人交以心，今人交以金。\n举世利交者，同利不同岑。\n阅人无贤愚，阅世无古今。\n众鸟归一林，众响叶一音。\n众交联一心，君子矢其忱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":283,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"感兴 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"蜩以五月鸣，槿以一朝繁。\n蜩鸣尚阅序，槿繁不及昏。\n饱露外何求，美荫周林园。\n所志在廉让，清响时一喧。\n嗟彼卉木荣，依托惟篱樊。\n萎华萧艾丛，浮艳谁与扪。\n下士学齐物，齐末遗本根。\n即目了可鉴，斯义匪躗言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":284,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐","author":"朱景英","text":"移榻当轩坐夜分，雨馀露气浸帘纹。\n度垣萤火微微见，隔牖花香细细闻。\n世阅大千还汎海，年过半百欲看云。\n无多梦寐天涯滞，华发灯前感易纷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":285,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"六月六日即事","author":"朱景英","text":"竹素丛残海外装，官閒偏为曝书忙。\n风床叶叶舒还卷，消受长天古墨香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":286,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"十一夜","author":"朱景英","text":"凉风入虚牖，初漏月痕敧。\n幽意少人会，息机惟自知。\n远怀许元度，愿学荣启期。\n何处寻真乐，清宵惬所思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":287,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜咏庭前杂卉四首","author":"朱景英","text":"小簇何郎雾夕诗，微波脉脉解通辞。\n怜渠欲堕犹开候，月下风前尔许思。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":288,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜咏庭前杂卉四首","author":"朱景英","text":"串串柔丝挂玉台，沅湘风味托琼瑰。\n凭教滴尽蟾蜍泪，不向方诸掬得来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":289,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜咏庭前杂卉四首","author":"朱景英","text":"瑶华影里见曼殊，鼻观参来淡欲无。\n薝卜入林香近远，晚风吹上十眉图。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":290,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夏夜咏庭前杂卉四首","author":"朱景英","text":"碎剪纤苞静夜分，短篱疏处逗微薰。\n动人芳杜思何限，露气江乡久不闻。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":291,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"过竹溪寺","author":"朱景英","text":"不见檀栾影，溪声听亦无。\n疏钟空际堕，古刹望中孤。\n径曲迷香篆，林荒冷苾刍。\n移时味禅悦，且复小跏趺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":292,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"午睡梦伯卿","author":"朱景英","text":"怀人不能已，江海故绵绵。\n浃岁阔颜色，音书来判年。\n频挥吹雨泪，忍诵停云篇。\n握手怅何许，西窗梦寐边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":293,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"朱景英","text":"每逢节序感无端，浮宦孤踪鬓欲残。\n磨蠍一宫身命厄，牵牛四度海天看。\n笙歌下里喧如沸，瓜果中宵语倍欢。\n转为情亲动遥思，针楼念否远人寒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":294,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"立秋日雨","author":"朱景英","text":"长日度无赖，远怀扪自幽。\n半晡微有雨，穷海镇宜秋。\n絺绤薄凉入，竹梧清响流。\n颇知尘事少，萧瑟转夷犹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":295,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋雨","author":"朱景英","text":"今年夏月风不号，亦罕骤雨来崇朝。\n乾鹊故不越海噪，阳乌只觉当空骄。\n入秋三日月离毕，漏天界破银河涛。\n摧颓四角黑云压，天浆直倒非倾瓢。\n霾昏失旦莫辨昼，溜响薄暮还连宵。\n时复撞搪户牖壁，挟势撇摋惊吹飙。\n青苔上砌础生菌，绿树踠地窗偃蕉。\n文书稀省颇自得，况听丛竹声萧萧。\n常时车马客到未，旧雨今雨从诙嘲。\n惟愁庳侧泥没踝，屋上捲去三重茅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":296,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寄题伯卿说剑图","author":"朱景英","text":"平生未买耶溪水，那解千里与十步。\n勇烈伯子说剑豪，绘图要我题诗句。\n自言用意故自别，须知不袭蒙庄说。\n书生从事羽林郎，七校移官来百越。\n又来海外窃斗糈，将领承平虚岁月。\n衋然动念先将军，遗匣尚留三尺铁。\n一试克靖萧关戎，再试直捣冉駹穴。\n龙身虎气经百磨，末路峨峨完大节。\n男儿三十不自立，忍使前人光遏佚。\n摩挲此铁铁依然，酬报何曾竭毫发。\n以此貌作兜鍪人，抚剑傍徨意彷佛。\n我闻君语睇君图，舐笔欲下还踌蹰。\n谓君意气颇自负，丹青渲染缨曼胡。\n周文矩画亦奇隽，讵如此图忠孝俱。\n卷图还君不敢作，君竟携之去灊霍。\n海门送别临清秋，隔岁风烟俨如昨。\n思君不见图亦邈，苍茫独咏期偿诺。\n诗成寄君君勿嗤，说剑如斯差不恶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":297,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤山道中 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"秋气偏迟到海涯，征舆触热走尘沙。\n雨馀少觉凉飔入，一路香吹晚稻花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":298,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤山道中 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"语经重译总差讹，诘曲村墟鹘突过。\n一事南来差不恶，山光揽得半屏多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":299,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤山道中 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"那曾仙袂挹浮邱，岭海中间自在游。\n咫尺阆风烟羃䍥，暮云不隔小流求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":300,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"凤山道中 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"深黑蛮溪束火来，乱流中夜困舆儓。\n少游数语关千古，讵独文渊首重回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":301,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宿郑氏庄","author":"朱景英","text":"此行非选胜，佳处小盘桓。\n泉响依阶细，藤阴覆径寒。\n流风溯如写，疏雨听将残。\n一夕秋声觉，萧然感百端。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":302,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"南社即事","author":"朱景英","text":"桄榔覆叶海棕直，丛筱钩枝野藤羃。\n缚茅编竹土抟甓，蜗壳中间杂庖湢。\n卸装小憩徕花蛮，赉以吉贝珠簪环。\n椰倾白酒袒割肉，醉饱諵諵齐万福。\n蛮奴拍手蛮妇歌，溪山乐事何其多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":303,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜雨阻水野次","author":"朱景英","text":"云黑四山雨，山泉百道流。\n坼崖声出涧，绝壑夜无舟。\n哭岂穷途效，宾谁一榻留。\n天明偏不肯，客路及中秋。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":304,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"闻五兄二侄两榇自福州归里不胜怆然","author":"朱景英","text":"客心故凄楚，重以死丧悲。\n同怀既异路，茹痛摧肝脾。\n栖魄小西湖，遐予海东陲。\n可怜风雨夜，对床杳无期。\n竛竮百忧丛，赖有犹子随。\n盛年忽短折，老泪惟承颐。\n忆昔衔恤奔，闽峤初牵丝。\n累岁骨肉惨，都在天一涯。\n人生乐仕宦，而我至于斯。\n樵川滩巀嵲，旴江濑逶迤。\n素旐从此去，故山日近之。\n朝来揽青铜，鬓发苍以衰。\n恸馀行自念，少壮岂其时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":305,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"送史皋文丹书返里","author":"朱景英","text":"跫然海外喜经过，归去其如装薄何。\n赏尔奇文追玉局，问谁曲室伴维摩。\n半屏山好游应倦，八月波平棹放歌。\n稳向钓龙台下住，空中莫惜寄书多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":306,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"九日","author":"朱景英","text":"久别篱边菊，来乘海上槎。\n一官远如客，九日倍思家。\n风雨亲朋阔，沅湘道路赊。\n凭高搔短发，吟望不胜嗟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":307,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾鉴沙棡伴梅图 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"高人只合占幽栖，一卷冰文避俗携。\n清到梅花圆个个，澹他尘梦小楼西。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":308,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾鉴沙棡伴梅图 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"霜华斑驳月黄昏，花底凌兢少慰存。\n却胜冲寒远相访，水边篱落竹边村。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":309,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾鉴沙棡伴梅图 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"阅世风烟老岁寒，为攀嘉树感无端。\n清芬的的君能诵，底补笙诗咏采兰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":310,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"顾鉴沙棡伴梅图 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"江乡花事近如何，读画天涯忍放歌。\n开遍早春三百树，不堪回首白云多。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":311,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其一","author":"朱景英","text":"藕丝孔里几由旬，十七芳华只幻尘。\n解道梅花如静女，疏香阁畔认前身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":312,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其二","author":"朱景英","text":"晨书暝写遍缣缃，点染丹铅亦擅场。\n识取毫端吹欲活，画叉乞与返生香。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":313,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其三","author":"朱景英","text":"观香妹子波微步，写韵仙人体迅飞。\n要是洛灵诸眷属，丹枫江上采珠归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":314,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其四","author":"朱景英","text":"泪叶飘零岁欲残，月明空怅画阑干。\n春风鬓影丹青见，肯许弹琴近坐看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":315,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其五","author":"朱景英","text":"一觉游仙雪爪痕，非非想亦画中论。\n何当无叶重翻案，更为梅花■爱根。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":316,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"明吴江女子叶小鸾自写小影为顾鉴沙题 其六","author":"朱景英","text":"一生心事吴江叶，得句曾将小篆镌。\n莺脰湖边消息断，花枝依旧蘸波鲜。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":317,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"朱景英","text":"归去若不早，胡为尚滞淫。\n乍醒残夜梦，犹役隔年心。\n境习忘殊俗，栖卑想故林。\n一灯相对坐，聊复白头吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":318,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"人日成成山司马招同解辛圃文燧王亮斋周立斋大本三明府集饮官斋","author":"朱景英","text":"四逢人日总晴天，物候今年得气先。\n腊冻未消花信逗，春盘初荐菜芽鲜。\n尊前谭笑庄谐杂，座上宾朋去住牵。\n取次东风挂帆好，南皮回指海云边。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":319,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]